Route110_Text_WeCantTalkAboutAquaActivities: @ 81EFB5D
	.string "水舰队的行动……\n"
	.string "这个现在还不能说。$"

Route110_Text_KickUpARuckus: @ 81EFB93
	.string "我想赶紧去凯那市\n"
	.string "大闹一场！$"

Route110_Text_MyFirstJobInAqua: @ 81EFBCA
	.string "这是我加入水舰队后的\n"
	.string "第一份差事。有点吓人。$"

Route110_Text_AquaActionsBringSmiles: @ 81EFC0D
	.string "水舰队的行动应该\n"
	.string "让人们露出笑容！$"

Route110_Text_MayLetsBattle: @ 81EFC48
	.string "小遥：嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}，好久不见！\p"
	.string "我在找其他宝可梦的时候，\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦也变强了。\p"
	.string "那么……\n"
	.string "来场小对战怎么样？$"

Route110_Text_MayDefeated: @ 81EFCCB
	.string "哇！你比我想的厉害！$"

Route110_Text_MayTakeThis: @ 81EFCF1
	.string "小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
	.string "你也一直在努力训练吧？\p"
	.string "我觉得你该得个奖励！\n"
	.string "这个给你！$"

Route110_Text_MayExplainItemfinder: @ 81EFD58
	.string "小遥：那是道具探测器。\p"
	.string "试试看吧。附近有看不见的道具时，\n"
	.string "它会发出声音。\p"
	.string "好，{PLAYER}{KUN}，下次再见！\p"
	.string "我知道这话由我说有点怪，\n"
	.string "不过下次见面之前，\p"
	.string "你该更努力地训练哦。$"

Route110_Text_BrendanLetsBattle: @ 81EFE3F
	.string "祐树：嘿，{PLAYER}。\n"
	.string "你在这儿啊。怎么样？\p"
	.string "有好好培养宝可梦吗？\n"
	.string "我来检查一下。$"

Route110_Text_BrendanDefeated: @ 81EFEB4
	.string "嗯……你还挺不错。$"

Route110_Text_BrendanTakeThis: @ 81EFECD
	.string "祐树：{PLAYER}，你不知不觉\n"
	.string "就练到这个程度了……\p"
	.string "够格了！来，拿着这个。$"

Route110_Text_BrendanExplainItemfinder: @ 81EFF1C
	.string "祐树：那是道具探测器。\p"
	.string "用它来找看不见的道具。\p"
	.string "一旦感应到什么，\n"
	.string "它就会发出声音。\p"
	.string "总之，我去找新宝可梦了。$"

Route110_Text_RideBikeAtFullSpeed: @ 81EFFC3
	.string "在自行车道上全速骑行，\n"
	.string "是不是很棒？$"

Route110_Text_HairStreamsBehindMe: @ 81F0006
	.string "我这头乌黑的长发\n"
	.string "在身后飘起来的样子，怎么样？\p"
	.string "我留长头发就是为了这个。$"

Route110_Text_YouGotBikeFromRydel: @ 81F006A
	.string "哦，嘿，那辆自行车\n"
	.string "是从利德尔那儿拿的！\p"
	.string "哦，太明显了。\n"
	.string "车上写得清清楚楚……\p"
	.string "利德尔、利德尔、利德尔、\n"
	.string "利德尔、利德尔、利德尔……\p"
	.string "到处都是这个名字。\p"
	.string "你应该骑着它到处跑：\n"
	.string "这是很好的广告！$"

Route110_Text_TwoRoads: @ 81F0261
	.string "上下两条路……\p"
	.string "人和宝可梦各走一条。\n"
	.string "也许这样才对，才公平。$"

Route110_Text_WalkOnTheLowRoad: @ 81F02CA
	.string "我没有自行车，\n"
	.string "就慢慢走下面那条路吧。$"

Route110_Text_BikeTechniques: @ 81F030E
	.string "学会技巧，骑车会更有趣。\p"
	.string "有些地方只有用技巧\n"
	.string "才能到达。$"

Route110_Text_WhichShouldIChoose: @ 81F0390
	.string "我该选哪条呢？\p"
	.string "是沿自行车道直奔紫堇市，\n"
	.string "还是走下面那条路找宝可梦？$"

Route110_Text_CyclingChallengeResultSummary: @ 81F03FF
	.string "碰撞次数：\n"
	.string "…… {STR_VAR_1}！\p"
	.string "总用时：\n"
	.string "…… {STR_VAR_2}！$"

Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionBest: @ 81F0431
	.string "太棒了！精彩的表现！\p"
	.string "你对骑行的热爱发自内心深处。\n"
	.string "你震撼了我的灵魂！$"

Route110_Text_GiveTM93:
	.string "请收下这个招式学习器，\n"
	.string "作为你骑行造诣的奖赏！$"

Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionGood: @ 81F04A4
	.string "你的技巧很出色。\p"
	.string "我建议你在避免碰撞的同时\n"
	.string "再加快一点速度。$"

Route110_Text_GiveTM83:
	.string "来，收下这只宝可梦，\n"
	.string "纪念你的成功。$"

Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionOk: @ 81F0500
	.string "我认为你还有进步空间。\p"
	.string "不过，希望你别忘了\n"
	.string "骑行本身的纯粹乐趣。$"

Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionBad: @ 81F0567
	.string "天哪……你的骑行技术\n"
	.string "简直有点吓人。\p"
	.string "你肯定还需要更多练习。$"

Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionWorst: @ 81F05CE
	.string "……我惊呆了……\p"
	.string "你也许不适合这项\n"
	.string "不幸的骑行事业。\p"
	.string "你该认真考虑\n"
	.string "把那辆自行车还给利德尔。$"

Route110_Text_RatedForNumberOfCollisions: @ 81F0661
	.string "这里是自行车道。\p"
	.string "如果骑音速自行车从紫堇市\n"
	.string "到凯那市，\p"
	.string "会根据碰撞次数和总用时评分。$"

Route110_Text_AlwaysAimHigher: @ 81F06FB
	.string "不管成绩如何，\n"
	.string "我都期待你再来挑战。\p"
	.string "永远瞄准更高！$"

Route110_Text_AcroBikesDoNotQualify: @ 81F0755
	.string "在这条自行车道上，\n"
	.string "骑音速自行车的人\p"
	.string "会按碰撞次数和总用时评分。\p"
	.string "飞跃自行车不参与评分。\n"
	.string "它转向太灵活，不公平。$"

Route110_Text_SlateportCitySign: @ 81F0812
	.string "110 号道路\n"
	.string "{DOWN_ARROW} 凯那市$"

Route110_Text_CyclingRoadSign: @ 81F082D
	.string "海边自行车道$"

Route110_Text_AquaWasHere: @ 81F0842
	.string "“水舰队到此一游！”\p"
	.string "有人把这句话涂在牌子上，\n"
	.string "后来又有人覆盖掉了。\p"
	.string "现在写的是：\n"
	.string "“火岩队最棒！”$"

Route110_Text_Route103Sign: @ 81F08CD
	.string "110 号道路\n"
	.string "{LEFT_ARROW} 103 号道路$"

Route110_Text_SeasideParkingSign: @ 81F08E3
	.string "海边停车场$"

Route110_Text_MauvilleCitySign: @ 81F08F3
	.string "110 号道路\n"
	.string "{UP_ARROW} 紫堇市$"

Route110_Text_TrainerTipsPrlzSleep: @ 81F090D
	.string "训练家小贴士\p"
	.string "让对手麻痹或睡着，\n"
	.string "就能使它无法行动。\p"
	.string "这是宝可梦对战中\n"
	.string "很重要的技巧。$"

Route110_Text_TrainerTipsRegisterItems: @ 81F0992
	.string "训练家小贴士\p"
	.string "按 Select 键可以\n"
	.string "重新整理包包里的道具。$"

Route110_Text_TrickHouseSign: @ 81F09DB
	.string "“向右三步，向上两步，\n"
	.string "就能到达神奇的戏法屋。”$"

Route110_Text_BestRecord: @ 81F0A1E
	.string "目前最佳纪录……\p"
	.string "碰撞次数：{STR_VAR_1}\p"
	.string "用时：{STR_VAR_2}$"

Route110_Text_ThereIsNoRecord: @ 81F0A5E
	.string "目前最佳纪录……\p"
	.string "似乎还没有人挑战过。\n"
	.string "暂无纪录……$"

Route110_Text_ImagineSeeingYouHere: @ 81F0AB5
	.string "小田卷博士：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
	.string "真没想到在这儿遇见你！\p"
	.string "我那{RIVAL}在哪儿呢？$"

Route110_Text_HeardYouInstallMatchCall: @ 81F0AFF
	.string "哦，原来如此！\n"
	.string "你们俩分开跑了。那也好。\p"
	.string "对了，我听说你的宝可梦领航器\n"
	.string "装了通讯呼叫系统。\p"
	.string "那么，我也该把你\n"
	.string "登记到我的领航器里。\p"
	.string "这样即使我们分开，\n"
	.string "我也能随时评价你的图鉴。\p"
	.string "…… …… ……$"

Route110_Text_RegisteredBirchInPokenav: @ 81F0C0C
	.string "已将小田卷博士\n"
	.string "登记到宝可梦领航器中。$"

Route110_Text_KeepAnEyeOutForRival: @ 81F0C33
	.string "小田卷博士：{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
	.string "请帮我留意一下我的{RIVAL}。\p"
	.string "…… …… ……\p"
	.string "好了，我该走了。\n"
	.string "再见，{PLAYER}{KUN}！$"

`
script Route110_Walking_EventScript_Gen8_NPC{
    lock
    faceplayer
	if(defeated(TRAINER_ISABEL_1) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_KALEB) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_TIMMY) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_EDWIN_1) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_JOSEPH) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_ALYSSA) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_EDWARD) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_DALE)){
		// when you defeat every trainer
		msgbox(format("嘿，你现在是摇滚明星了！$"))
		givemon(SPECIES_TOXEL, 10, ITEM_NONE)
		playfanfare(MUS_OBTAIN_ITEM)
		message(format("{PLAYER}获得了{COLOR BLUE}电音婴{COLOR DARK_GRAY}，\n这是打败所有训练家的礼物！$"))
		waitfanfare
	}
	else{
		// before defeating every trainer here
		msgbox(format("有人曾对我说：\n“训练家会把它们全打趴！”\p打起精神，去玩一场吧！$"))
	}
    release
    end
}

script Route110_CyclingRoad_EventScript_Gen8_NPC{
    lock
    faceplayer
	if(defeated(TRAINER_ABIGAIL_1) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_ANTHONY) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_BENJAMIN_1) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_JASMINE) &&
	   defeated(TRAINER_JACOB)){
		// when you defeat every trainer
		msgbox(format("蒸汽又赢了！\p来，收下这件自然与科技的奇迹，\n作为感谢与认可的证明！$"))
		givemon(SPECIES_ROLYCOLY, 10, ITEM_NONE)
		playfanfare(MUS_OBTAIN_ITEM)
		message(format("{PLAYER}获得了{COLOR BLUE}小炭仔{COLOR DARK_GRAY}，\n这是打败自行车道上所有训练家的礼\p物！$"))
		waitfanfare
	}
	else{
		// before defeating every trainer here
		msgbox(format("你知道吗？伽勒尔人以前\n会用宝可梦驱动机械！\p你也能拥有一只蒸汽动力的宝可梦，\n不过得先给这些只会蹬自行车的\p丰缘人上一课！$"))
	}
    release
    end
}


text Route110_Text_ObtainedHeliolisk{
	format("{PLAYER}获得了{COLOR BLUE}光电伞蜥{COLOR DARK_GRAY}。$")
}

text Route110_Text_ObtainedShinyHeliolisk{
	format("{PLAYER}获得了异色{COLOR BLUE}光电伞蜥{COLOR DARK_GRAY}。$")
}